osm	w256733182	bac8def6-6d31-5050-a445-7e2c45122e13	\N	{"fax": "+1-855-928-5255", "name": "Great Star Theater", "email": "management@GreatStarTheater.org", "image": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Great_Star_Theater_night.jpg", "phone": "+1-415-735-4159", "height": "9", "amenity": "theatre", "name:en": "Great Star Theater", "name:es": "Gran Teatro Estrella", "name:fr": "Théâtre Great Star", "name:hi": "ग्रेट स्टार थियेटर", "name:ja": "グレートスターシアター", "name:ko": "그레이트 스타 극장", "name:ru": "Театр Great Star", "name:zh": "大星剧院", "website": "https://greatstartheater.org", "alt_name": "Great Star Theatre", "building": "yes", "capacity": "500", "operator": "Roger Pincombe;Alice Chu;Paul Nathan", "wikidata": "Q44634130", "addr:city": "San Francisco", "wikipedia": "en:Great Star Theater", "addr:state": "CA", "wheelchair": "yes", "addr:street": "Jackson Street", "description": "The 501c Great Star Theater, the last remaining Chinese theater in any U.S. Chinatown, hosts a variety of performances including Cantonese opera, guzheng, magic, acrobatics, and films, while promoting cultural diversity and supporting emerging artists.", "contact:yelp": "https://yelp.com/biz/great-star-theater-san-francisco-2", "name:ja-Hira": "ぐれーとすたーしあたー", "name:ja-Latn": "Gurēto Sutā Shiatā", "name:zh-Hans": "大星剧院", "name:zh-Hant": "大星劇院", "theatre:type": "stage", "addr:postcode": "94133", "theatre:genre": "cabaret;acrobatics;magic;circus;guzheng;opera;Cantonese opera;comedy;tech talks;variety", "description:en": "The Great Star Theater, the last remaining Chinese theater in any U.S. Chinatown, hosts a variety of performances including Cantonese opera, guzheng, magic, acrobatics, and films, while promoting cultural diversity and supporting emerging artists.", "description:es": "El Great Star Theater, el último teatro chino en cualquier Chinatown de EE. UU., presenta actuaciones como ópera cantonesa, guzheng, magia, acrobacias y películas, promoviendo la diversidad cultural y apoyando a artistas emergentes.", "description:fr": "Le Great Star Theater, dernier théâtre chinois dans un Chinatown américain, propose des spectacles variés comme l'opéra cantonais, le guzheng, la magie, l'acrobatie et des films, tout en soutenant la diversité culturelle et les artistes émergents.", "description:hi": "ग्रेट स्टार थियेटर, अमेरिका के किसी भी चाइनाटाउन में अंतिम शेष चीनी थियेटर है, जो विभिन्न प्रदर्शन आयोजित करता है, जिसमें कांतोनिज़ ओपेरा, गुज़ेंग, जादू, एक्रोबेटिक्स और फिल्में शामिल हैं, जबकि सांस्कृतिक विविधता को बढ़ावा देता है और उभरते कलाकारों का समर", "description:ja": "グレートスターシアターは、アメリカのチャイナタウンに残る唯一の中国劇場で、広東オペラ、古箏、マジック、アクロバット、映画などの多様なパフォーマンスを開催し、文化的多様性を促進し、新進アーティストを支援しています。", "description:ko": "그레이트 스타 극장은 미국 차이나타운에 남아 있는 유일한 중국 극장으로, 광둥 오페라, 구젠, 마술, 곡예, 영화 등 다양한 공연을 개최하며 문화적 다양성을 촉진하고 신진 예술가를 지원합니다.", "description:ru": "Театр Great Star, последний оставшийся китайский театр в любом китайском квартале США, проводит разнообразные представления, включая кантонскую оперу, гуджэн, магию, акробатику и фильмы, продвигая культурное разнообразие и поддерживая начинающих артистов.", "description:zh": "大星剧院是美国任何华埠中最后一座中国剧院，举办多种表演，包括粤剧、古筝、魔术、杂技和电影，同时促进文化多样性并支持新兴艺术家。", "contact:youtube": "greatstartheater", "website:tickets": "https://greatstartheater.org/whats-playing", "addr:housenumber": "636", "contact:facebook": "TheGreatStarTheater", "contact:instagram": "greatstartheater", "wikimedia_commons": "Category:Great Star Theater", "contact:tripadvisor": "https://tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g60713-d10676790-Reviews-The_Great_Star_Theater-San_Francisco_California.html", "description:ja-Hira": "ぐれーとすたーしあたーは、あめりかのちゃいなたうんにのこるゆいいつのちゅうごくげきじょうで、かんとんおぺら、こそう、まじっく、あくろばっと、えいがなどのたようなぱふぉーまんすをかいさいし、ぶんかてきたようせいをそくしんし、しんしんあーてぃすとをしえんしています。", "description:ja-Latn": "Gurēto Sutā Shiatā wa, Amerika no Chainatown ni nokoru yuiitsu no Chūgoku gekijō de, Kantō opera, guzheng, majikku, akurobatto, eiga nado no tayōna pafōmansu o kaisai shi, bunkateki tayōsei o sokushin shi, shinshin ātisuto o shien shiteimasu.", "description:zh-Hans": "大星剧院是美国任何华埠中最后一座中国剧院，举办多种表演，包括粤剧、古筝、魔术、杂技和电影，同时促进文化多样性并支持新兴艺术家。", "description:zh-Hant": "大星劇院是美國任何華埠中最後一座中國劇院，舉辦多種表演，包括粵劇、古箏、魔術、雜技和電影，同時促進文化多樣性並支持新興藝術家。"}	2026-11-06 23:57:47.1796+00
